---
import PublicLayout from '../layouts/PublicLayout.astro';

const title = "Privacy Policy | ColorAuto Detailing";
const description = "Privacy Policy for ColorAuto Detailing — how we collect, use, and protect your personal information.";
---

<PublicLayout {title} {description}>
  <main id="main-content" class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-16">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold mb-2">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm mb-10">Last updated: April 30, 2026</p>

    <section class="prose prose-gray max-w-none space-y-8">

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-3">1. Who We Are</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
          ColorAuto Detailing ("we," "us," or "our") operates <strong>colorautodetailing.com</strong> and
          provides professional auto detailing, paint protection film, ceramic coating, and window tinting
          services in Grand Junction, CO. You can reach us at:
        </p>
        <ul class="mt-3 space-y-1 text-gray-700">
          <li><strong>Address:</strong> 562 S. Westgate Drive, Grand Junction, CO 81505</li>
          <li><strong>Phone:</strong> <a href="tel:970-628-1505" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">970-628-1505</a></li>
          <li><strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:admin@colorautodetailing.com" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">admin@colorautodetailing.com</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-3">2. Information We Collect</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-3">
          We collect information you provide directly to us and information collected automatically when you
          visit our site.
        </p>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold mb-2">Information you provide:</h3>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-1 text-gray-700">
          <li>Name, email address, and phone number (quote requests and contact forms)</li>
          <li>Vehicle details and service preferences you include in messages</li>
          <li>Phone number for SMS chat support (optional)</li>
        </ul>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold mt-4 mb-2">Information collected automatically:</h3>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-1 text-gray-700">
          <li>IP address, browser type, and device information</li>
          <li>Pages visited, time on site, and referral source</li>
          <li>UTM parameters from advertising campaigns</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-3">3. How We Use Your Information</h2>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-1 text-gray-700">
          <li>Respond to your quote requests, inquiries, and appointment bookings</li>
          <li>Send service confirmations and follow-up communications</li>
          <li>Send SMS messages if you opt in through our chat widget</li>
          <li>Improve our website and marketing campaigns</li>
          <li>Comply with legal obligations</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-3">4. Third-Party Services</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-3">
          We use the following third-party services that may collect data on our behalf:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-gray-700">
          <li><strong>Google Analytics & Google Tag Manager</strong> — website traffic and behavior analytics. <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">Google Privacy Policy</a>.</li>
          <li><strong>Meta Pixel (Facebook/Instagram)</strong> — advertising measurement and remarketing. <a href="https://www.facebook.com/privacy/explanation" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">Meta Privacy Policy</a>.</li>
          <li><strong>Resend</strong> — transactional email delivery for form submissions.</li>
          <li><strong>Supabase</strong> — secure database for bookings and customer data.</li>
          <li><strong>Google reCAPTCHA v3</strong> — bot protection on forms. <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">Google Privacy Policy</a>.</li>
          <li><strong>OpenPhone (Quo)</strong> — SMS messaging if you use our chat widget.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-3">5. SMS Communications</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
          If you provide your phone number through our chat widget, you consent to receive SMS messages from
          ColorAuto Detailing related to your inquiry. Message and data rates may apply. You can opt out at
          any time by replying <strong>STOP</strong> to any message.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-3">6. Cookies</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
          Our website uses cookies and similar tracking technologies from Google Analytics, Google Tag Manager,
          and Meta Pixel. These help us understand how visitors use our site and measure the effectiveness of
          our advertising. You can disable cookies in your browser settings, but some site features may not
          function properly.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-3">7. Data Retention</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
          We retain your contact information for as long as necessary to fulfill the purposes described in
          this policy or as required by law. Quote requests and contact form submissions are retained for
          up to 2 years for business records.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-3">8. Your Rights</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-3">
          You have the right to:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-1 text-gray-700">
          <li>Request access to the personal data we hold about you</li>
          <li>Request correction or deletion of your data</li>
          <li>Opt out of marketing communications at any time</li>
          <li>Opt out of Meta ad targeting via <a href="https://www.facebook.com/ads/preferences" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">Facebook Ad Preferences</a></li>
        </ul>
        <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mt-3">
          To exercise these rights, contact us at <a href="mailto:admin@colorautodetailing.com" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">admin@colorautodetailing.com</a>.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-3">9. Children's Privacy</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
          Our services are not directed to children under 13. We do not knowingly collect personal information
          from children under 13. If you believe we have inadvertently collected such information, please
          contact us immediately.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-3">10. Changes to This Policy</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
          We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. The "Last updated" date at the top of this
          page reflects the most recent revision. Continued use of our site after changes constitutes
          acceptance of the updated policy.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-3">11. Contact Us</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
          If you have questions about this Privacy Policy, please contact us:
        </p>
        <ul class="mt-3 space-y-1 text-gray-700">
          <li><strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:admin@colorautodetailing.com" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">admin@colorautodetailing.com</a></li>
          <li><strong>Phone:</strong> <a href="tel:970-628-1505" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">970-628-1505</a></li>
          <li><strong>Mail:</strong> 562 S. Westgate Drive, Grand Junction, CO 81505</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

    </section>
  </main>
</PublicLayout>
